# TypeScript Standards

## Type Rules

| Rule | Enforcement |
|------|-------------|
| **Strict mode** | No `any` — use `unknown` if truly unknown |
| **Generics** | Use for reusable typed components |
| **Inference** | Let TS infer when possible, explicit when needed |
| **Utility Types** | Partial, Pick, Omit, Record, Awaited |

---

## Error Handling

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
try {
  await fetchData();
} catch (e) {}

// ✅ GOOD
try {
  await fetchData();
} catch (e) {
  logger.error('Failed to fetch', { error: e });
  throw new DataFetchError('Unable to retrieve data', { cause: e });
}
```

